# 91. Why Is Training So Expensive?

A large model may contain:

```text
Billions of parameters
```

Training requires repeated operations across:

```text
Huge datasets
+
Many batches
+
Many training steps
```

Therefore organizations need:

```text
Large GPU clusters
Fast networking
Large memory
High-speed storage
Electricity
Cooling
Monitoring
