# 97. Training, Validation and Test Data

Traditional ML often separates data into:

```text
Dataset
 ├── Training
 ├── Validation
 └── Test
```

## Training data

Used to update parameters.

## Validation data

Used to evaluate/tune decisions during development.

## Test data

Used for final evaluation.

The exact methodology for large language models can be more complex.

