# 136. Beginner Exercise 4

You have:

```text
100,000 documents
```

and they change every week.

Should you immediately fine-tune the LLM every week?

Not necessarily.

A RAG system may be more appropriate:

```text
Documents
 ↓
Index
 ↓
Retrieve current information
 ↓
LLM
```

because the knowledge can be updated without changing the model weights.

